{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Post a bounty"},"description":"Post a bounty. It is paid for from your wallet at once when the balance covers it; use dryRun to see the cost first.\nUse for: posting new work. A short wallet saves a draft with `payUrl`, when a pay page could be made. Without `payUrl`, add money with fund_wallet, then call fund_bounty. Send an idempotencyKey to reuse the first bounty and ignore new input. Unkeyed retries may post again or be refused as duplicates; check list_bounties first.\nNot for: paying for a draft (fund_bounty).\nMoney: US cents.\nReplies omit a field's sole empty value. If null is allowed, only null is omitted; false, [] and a present group stay. A present empty group is {}. Field descriptions explain unavailable values.\nExample: create_bounty({\"title\":\"Photograph the storefront of 5 coffee shops\",\"description\":\"Walk to each of the 5 listed coffee shops and take one clear photo of the storefront in daylight.\",\"category\":\"creative-gigs\",\"pay\":{\"type\":\"fixed\",\"amount\":1999,\"estimatedHours\":2},\"spots\":{\"total\":3},\"location\":{\"country\":\"US\",\"isRemoteAllowed\":true},\"proof\":{\"criteria\":\"Five photos, one per shop, each showing the shop sign.\",\"types\":[\"photo\"]}})\nRepeat: A repeat may act again on the thing as it stands then. Read it first.\nErrors: listing_refused, pay_below_minimum, duplicate_listing, spending_limit_reached, account_setup_required, wallet_short, create_in_progress, photos_not_available; each error carries `fix`: what to do next.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ai":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"screening":{"description":"Default false.","type":"boolean"},"submissionReview":{"description":"Default false.","type":"boolean"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"applications":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"closesAt":{"type":"string"},"keepPendingWhenFull":{"description